# Slime Against Humanity counts the cards its controller owns in their graveyard and in exile that are Oozes or are named Slime Against Humanity.
# Bot1 exiles its own Primordial Ooze (Swords to Plowshares, 1), discards Necrotic Ooze (an Ooze, 1) and a second Slime Against Humanity (named, 1) to Faithless Looting; the Looting
# itself and the Swords in the graveyard (neither an Ooze) count nothing. X = 2 + 3 = 5: a 5/5 Ooze token.

[Bot1 Deck]
Primordial Ooze
Swords to Plowshares
Faithless Looting
Slime Against Humanity
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Slime Against Humanity
Necrotic Ooze
Forest x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Primordial Ooze.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Primordial Ooze)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Primordial Ooze
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Slime Against Humanity; Necrotic Ooze)
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Slime Against Humanity.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ooze Token.Power = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Ooze Token.Toughness = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Ooze Token.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 5
